'''Shyloah's Crest''' was a location found on the remote ice world of [[Hoth]]. Sometime after the [[Battle of Hoth]] and before the [[Battle of Endor]], a battle between the [[Alliance to Restore the Republic|Rebel Alliance]] and [[Galactic Empire]] occurred here.<ref name="C" />

